@label sct:67734004 "Structure of thoracic segment of trunk (body structure)"
@ann sct:67734004 skos:altLabel "Structure of thoracic segment of trunk"
@ann sct:67734004 skos:altLabel "Upper trunk"
@ann sct:67734004 skos:altLabel "Upper trunk structure"
@ann sct:67734004 skos:definition "This segment relates to the volume of the trunk that is bounded by and includes: superiorly the thoracic inlet; inferiorly the thoracic diaphragm; posteriorly the spinal column and back of the thorax; and laterally the chest wall: it contains the thoracic cavity and contents, and includes all the overlying muscles, skin and subcutaneous tissue."
@ann sct:67734004 skos:prefLabel "Thoracic segment of trunk"
sct:67734004 ⊑ sct:70104002 ⊓ sct:816094009

